BBUUGGSS
     There should probably be an interface to de-allocate memory allocated by
     ddeevvssttaatt__ggeettddeevvss(), ddeevvssttaatt__sseelleeccttddeevvss(), and ddeevvssttaatt__bbuuiillddmmaattcchh().

     The ddeevvssttaatt__sseelleeccttddeevvss() function should probably not select more than
     _m_a_x_s_h_o_w_d_e_v_s devices in “top” mode when no devices have been selected pre‐
     viously.

     There should probably be functions to perform the statistics buffer swap‐
     ping that goes on in most of the clients of this library.

     The _s_t_a_t_i_n_f_o and _d_e_v_i_n_f_o structures should probably be cleaned up and
     thought out a little more.

